A recurring example is a rise in cost per lead. I compare the same campaign scope across periods, inspect the traffic and conversion signals, then ask for hypotheses about the selected finding. A weaker response after the click could justify testing the offer or landing page, but I still check tracking, sample size and follow-up before choosing a test.

That decision process is what I want the tool to support. AI proposes a direction; I review it against the campaign evidence and decide what to test.
